As an intern within Paid Social you will join a dedicated team and work with digital marketing, focusing on paid advertising on social media. With us, you will have the opportunity to work with some of Sweden's and the world's most ambitious brands using market-leading technology. We place great emphasis on developing our teams, and in close collaboration with platforms, you will be involved in testing new creative formats and solutions. &nbsp;

Our office is located on Birger Jarlsgatan in Stockholm, and for the right candidate, there may be opportunities to continue your career with us after the internship.&nbsp;
&nbsp;
Who are you?&nbsp;
&nbsp;
We believe you’re a student in media, marketing or economics, and have a strong interest in digital marketing. You’re eager to learn, contribute with new ideas, have a self-driven attitude, detail-oriented, and enjoy working closely with others.

To join our team as an intern, you need to:

• Be available for at least 8 weeks

• Do your internship through a school or the Swedish Public Employment Service (Arbetsförmedlingen)

• Be available full-time during standard office hours

• Be fluent in Swedish and comfortable using English

• Be available to work full-time at our office in Stockholm with some hybrid flexibility

Please note: this internship is unpaid.&nbsp;

Interested?&nbsp;
Apply with your CV and include a short note about why you’d like to intern with us. Be sure to include the period you're applying for.&nbsp;
&nbsp;&nbsp;
Contact&nbsp;
If you have questions about the Paid Social internship, contact Hanna Cleve, Senior Activation Manager at&nbsp; hanna.cleve@wppmedia.com . Due to GDPR, we do not accept applications via email. &nbsp;

Please read our Privacy Notice &nbsp; for more information on how we process the information you provide. &nbsp;

